Z||000002||California Kid||11-21-2001||07:59 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTMike:<BR><B>theres not much to that is there.  i'm thinking of makeing one  but i'm wondering what to put under the grate so that you just dont see down into the shiting cabels between the grates.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>First you find a rubber body sheetmetal grommet that fits snug on your shifter shaft. Next, find some very stretchy black cloth, make a rectangular frame, bond cloth to frame and grommet, etc,etc.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_7.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 11-21-2001).]||||reg||1
